{{Documentation}}
Provides various image functions. Largely the same as [[Module:Cat images]] with the exception of instead of requiring an ID and a form, it just requires the cat.

Also provides a function <code>image_str</code>. Usage is as such:
<syntaxhighlight lang="lua">
local image = Cat.image_str(cat, 'deploy', { size = "30px" })
</syntaxhighlight>
First argument is the cat, second argument is the function name, third is a list of args to pass to [[Module:File link]].